      "value": "\n\n\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Prerequisites</strong> Dragonmarked Scion Dedication, Lesser Mark</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You have trained to develop your talents and your dragonmark. You gain the @Compendium[pathfinders-guide-to-eberron.eberron-dragonmarks.VKwy41qLO6UQkgOy]{Greater Mark} feat.<br /><strong>Special</strong> Since this manifests a physical change in the powers and size of your dragonmark, you may not retrain out of this feat.</p>\n"
